<title>MOROCCO: Morocco April consumer prices +1.4 pct, +0.6 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Morocco April consumer prices +1.4 pct, +0.6 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Statistics Directorate issued on Monday the following economic indicators:</p>
<p>    MOROCCO'S CONSUMER PRICES: April 97    March 97</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)   +1.4	   -0.4</p>
<p>    Year/year change	     +0.6	   -1.7</p>
<p>(Base:100 points - 1989)</p>
<p>This relatively slight increase is attributed to the 2.4 percent drop in costs of food products, the directorate said.</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 72 65 18</p>
</text>
